"Speed limits, connections per torrent, upload slots and seeding are set for each torrent when you add it, or later under Torrent Settings. Torrents use the proxy from the Connection tab (HTTP or SOCKS5, or the Mac's proxy with \"Use the system settings\") and the speed limit for all downloads. Changes apply to torrents started afterwards. Peers and trackers can see your IP address, or your proxy's." = "Kuletsa kwa liwiro, kulumikizana kwa ma torrent, kutsitsa ma sloti ndi kusonkhana kumakonzedwa kwa ma torrent onse pamene mumawawonjezera, kapena pambuyo pake pansi pa Zosankha za Torrent. Ma torrent amagwiritsa ntchito proxy kuchokera pa tab ya Kulumikizana (HTTP kapena SOCKS5, kapena proxy ya Mac ndi \"Use the system settings\") ndi kuletsa kwa liwiro kwa ma download onse. Zosinthazi zimagwira ntchito kwa ma torrent omwe ayamba pambuyo pake. Ogwirizana ndi otsatira amatha kuona adiresi yanu ya IP, kapena ya proxy yanu.";
"Settings used for every download from a website. A site also covers its subdomains (example.com covers www.example.com). Logins are only sent to that site and are kept with the app's other secrets." = "Zosankha zomwe zimagwiritsidwa ntchito pazotsitsa zonse kuchokera pa webusaitiyi. Webusaitiyi imaphatikizaponso subdomains zake (example.com imaphatikizapo www.example.com). Ma logins amatumizidwa kokha kwa webusaitiyi ndipo amasungidwa ndi ma secrets ena a pulogalamuyo.";
"A backup holds your settings, site settings, queues and the downloads list. Passwords and cookies are never put in a backup." = "Kubwezeretsa kumasunga zosankha zanu, zosankha zatsamba, zosakira ndi mndandanda wazotsitsa. Malamulo achitetezo ndi ma cookie saikangidwanso m'kubwezeretsa.";
"When you copy a link that ends in one of these types, the Add window opens with it." = "Pamene inu kukopera kugwirizana kuti kumatha m'modzi wa izi mitundu, Add zenera amatsegula ndi izo.";
"Expected checksums are checked automatically when a download finishes. Queues can also quit the app, sleep or shut down the Mac when they are done (Scheduler)." = "Kuyembekezeredwa checksums anayesedwa mwamsanga pamene kutsitsa kumatha. Queues akhozanso kutuluka pulogalamu, kugona kapena kuletsa Mac pamene iwo anamaliza (Scheduler).";
"Save the extension folder, open the browser's extensions page, switch on Developer mode, choose Load unpacked and pick the folder." = "Tengani fayilo ya kuwonjezera, pezani tsamba la kuwonjezera la msakatuli, yambitsani modes ya Developer, sankhani Load unpacked ndi kusankha fayilo.";
"Save the add-on file and drag it onto a Firefox window. Firefox installs add-ons that are signed; see the README for signing your copy." = "Gwiritsani ntchito fayilo yowonjezera ndikuipukutira pazenera la Firefox. Firefox imayika zowonjezera zomwe zili ndi saini; onani README kuti mupange saini ya kope lanu.";
"Install the ndm command, then for example: ndm https://example.com/file.zip --queue Night" = "Kukhazikitsa ndm lamulo, ndiye mwachitsanzo: ndm https://example.com/file.zip --queue Night";
