"Put a range in square brackets: [001-100] keeps three digits, [1-100] does not, [a-z] uses letters and [0-100:5] counts in fives. Several ranges multiply." = "Ikani mndandanda m'makwerero: [001-100] imagwiritsa ntchito zigawo zitatu, [1-100] siyigwiritsa ntchito, [a-z] imagwiritsa ntchito malemba ndi [0-100:5] imawerengera ndi zigawo zisanu.";
